title    A Valsa da Rainha
composer Claude
about    Tema de Morgana. Uma valsa macabra em si menor: órgão de tubos, coro, sinos e tímpanos.
tempo    132
beats    3
steps    4
reverb   0.5

voice lead  saw       vol=0.55 pan=-0.15 bright=0.5
voice organ pipe      vol=0.7  pan=0.1
voice choir choir     vol=0.55 pan=0.2  center=G4
voice bell  bell      vol=0.4  pan=0.35
voice timp  timpani   vol=0.8
voice snare snare     vol=0.4  pan=0.1
voice crash crash     vol=0.35 pan=-0.2

pattern intro
choir | [Bm]----------- | [F#]----------- |
organ | B2----------- | F#2----------- |
timp  | B2 . . . . . . . B2 . B2 . | F#2 . . . F#2 . F#2 . F#2! F#2! F#2!! . |
bell  | B5----------- | _ |

# ------------------------------------------------ A: a dança da rainha
pattern A
lead  | B5--- D6--- F#6--- | E6--- D6--- C#6--- | D6--- B5--- G5--- | F#5----------- |
lead  | B5--- D6--- F#6--- | G6--- F#6--- E6--- | D6- E6- F#6- E6- C#6--- | B5----------- |
organ | B2--- [Bm]--- [Bm]--- | A2--- [A]--- [A]--- | G2--- [G]--- [G]--- | F#2--- [F#]--- [F#]--- |
organ | B2--- [Bm]--- [Bm]--- | E2--- [Em]--- [Em]--- | F#2--- [F#]--- [F#]--- | B2--- [Bm]--- [Bm]--- |
timp  | B2 . . . . . . . . . . . | A2 . . . . . . . . . . . | G2 . . . . . . . . . . . | F#2 . . . F#2 . . . F#2 . F#2 . |
timp  | B2 . . . . . . . . . . . | E2 . . . . . . . . . . . | F#2 . . . F#2 . F#2 . F#2! F#2! F#2!! . | B2 . . . . . . . . . . . |
snare | .... x... x... | % | % | % | % | % | % | xxxx XXXX XXXX |
crash | X........... | _ | _ | _ | X........... | _ | _ | _ |
bell  | B5----------- | _ | _ | _ | B5----------- | _ | _ | _ |

# ------------------------------------------------ B: o coro dos lamentos
pattern B
organ | G5--- B5--- D6--- | F#5--- A5--- C#6--- | E5--- G5--- B5--- | F#5----------- |
organ | G5- A5- B5- C#6- D6--- | E6--- D6--- C#6--- | D6--- C#6--- A#5--- | B5----------- |
choir | [G]----------- | [F#]----------- | [Em]----------- | [F#]----------- |
choir | [G]----------- | [A]----------- | [F#]----------- | [Bm]----------- |
timp  | G2 . . . . . . . . . . . | F#2 . . . . . . . . . . . | E2 . . . . . . . . . . . | F#2 . . . F#2 . . . F#2 . F#2 . |
timp  | G2 . . . . . . . . . . . | A2 . . . . . . . . . . . | F#2 . . . F#2 . F#2 . F#2! F#2! F#2!! . | B2 . . . . . . . . . . . |
snare | .... x... x... | % | % | % | % | % | % | xxxx XXXX XXXX |
bell  | G5----------- | _ | _ | _ | D6----------- | _ | _ | _ |

play intro
loop A B
